WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.787
Step 1. Open the registration form.

1.2
00:00:02.787 --> 00:00:06.920
Search first, so the same person is not registered twice.

1.3
00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.537
On Search patients, select Add New Patient.

2.1
00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:13.188
Step 2. Enter the patient basics.

2.2
00:00:13.188 --> 00:00:18.063
Name, Phone Number, Sex, and the date of birth or age are required.

2.3
00:00:18.063 --> 00:00:27.495
Blood Group is optional. A date of birth cannot be in the future.

3.1
00:00:27.495 --> 00:00:30.297
Step 3. Enter the additional details.

3.2
00:00:30.297 --> 00:00:35.124
Enter the address, then select the patient's area one level at a time,

3.3
00:00:35.124 --> 00:00:42.744
starting with State. Care adds a dropdown for each next level.

4.1
00:00:42.744 --> 00:00:46.863
Step 5. Register the patient. Select Register Patient.

4.2
00:00:46.863 --> 00:00:52.379
Care shows Patient Registered Successfully and opens Patient Home for the new

4.3
00:00:52.379 --> 00:00:53.452
patient.
